### pobieranie przedmiotu z szafy

GET {{api}}/api/ItemPartition/wardrobe/97BA753C-67A0-470B-AF5A-4939B4B3ED58/item/656CF39D-6A97-46A7-9202-36E078E0A8A5?quantity=1
Accept: application/json

### pobieranie przedmiotu z szafy FIFO

GET {{api}}/api/ItemPartition/fifo/wardrobe/97BA753C-67A0-470B-AF5A-4939B4B3ED58/item/656CF39D-6A97-46A7-9202-36E078E0A8A5?quantity=1&userId=4C6DE142-BE4A-437E-BCDE-08DE97F47956
Accept: application/json

